WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:26.100
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:39.760
Sergeant!

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:44.130
Sergeant! Hold on!

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:46.930
Please escape while you can!

00:01:47.660 --> 00:01:52.120
- I can't go on any longer.
- Don't be foolish! Don't give up!

00:01:57.730 --> 00:02:01.490
You are surrounded! 
 Throw your weapons away!

00:02:05.150 --> 00:02:11.010
- Lieutenant. 
- I leave the rest up to Goslen.

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:23.020
There's an emergency!
 Lieutenant Noei was arrested!

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:31.400
Unmerging Ideas

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:43.440
Just as I thought. 
 You were the perpetrator, Quinza!

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:47.360
It's been a while, Noei.

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:53.950
Quinza, what is it that you wish for?! 
 What kind of throne is it if you destroy the country?!

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:58.160
You were formerly an officer for the royalty.

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:02.550
You know how rotten this place is.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:07.140
The former king was active in foreign diplomacy...

00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:10.040
...but he didn't show any interest in domestic affairs.

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:15.390
The chamberlains thought only to enrich themselves.

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:22.490
<i>Thank you for always thinking about us.</i>

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:29.250
It was obvious. If Somand became the king, that kind of behavior would be rampant.

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:32.490
This is what I thought.

00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:38.990
Miraculously, Rumaty grew up in this trash bin unadulterated and pure.

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:43.040
He would be our savior. That's what I thought.

00:03:43.930 --> 00:03:46.640
But, we didn't have enough time.

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:49.660
Waiting for His Highness Rumaty to grow up.

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:52.820
Preparing for the reform.

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:56.700
We were only left with a spur of the moment plan.

00:03:57.370 --> 00:04:01.350
Quinza, our ideas are practically the same.

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:05.110
But why did we end up fighting against each other?

00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:09.510
You have no righteousness in you! 
 All you have are deceitful plans!

00:04:10.210 --> 00:04:12.790
Deceitful plans? Call it what you want.

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:15.980
In order for this country to change, it must bleed.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:20.470
A king that sits on a throne made of deceitful plans won't be accepted!

00:04:29.190 --> 00:04:33.810
Our opinions contradict. Our ideas are too different.

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:39.390
To create the ideal government, I don't fear any animosity.

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:42.290
These are your confessions.

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:47.030
After interrogation, you break and confess.

00:04:48.590 --> 00:04:54.010
This lists the officers and statesmen that collaborated with you.

00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:57.130
They will go after you.

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:01.300
A dead man can't speak, huh?

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:06.900
Even in the upper echelons of the government, an anti-king faction is gaining momentum.

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:13.220
- They need to be sacrificed so that people will understnad. 
- Quinza! That's a crime!

00:05:13.630 --> 00:05:19.170
- It's an evil plan that's beyond your ideals! 
- You're scheduled to be executed a week from now.

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:25.800
Go to the land of fire seeking your justice!

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:30.000
I will go to hell seeking mine!

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:32.650
We'll never meet again.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:43.380
Quinza! His Highness Rumaty is not one to sit on a bloody throne!

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:49.020
Why can't you understand that?! Quinza! Quinza!

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:53.000
Quinza!

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:59.280
Why can't we come to an understanding?

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:04.790
Why can he only use his smarts for evil?!

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:10.200
You've lost all hope... I didn't realize that until now.

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:20.050
Therefore that makes Harry Burnsworth the king of Raginei.

00:06:20.430 --> 00:06:24.380
His daughter is first in line to succeed the throne.

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:27.180
It makes her, "Her Majesty."

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:31.420
Kajika is...

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:37.410
If Quinza is told about this, Kajika's life will be in danger.

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:40.500
I have to divert his attention.

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:43.750
Where are you Kajika?!

00:06:47.350 --> 00:06:49.740
- Excuse me.
- About that plan...

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:52.030
We're ready.

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:23.950
With this I'm able to take back Raginei from Burnsworth.

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:29.010
What an awful delusion.

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:43.000
What's happening?!

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:46.950
Robbers?! Don't open the door Carl!

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:50.830
Our life is more precious!

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:55.040
You scumbags!

00:07:57.010 --> 00:08:01.150
- Not that!
- Father! - Give it back!

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:04.470
I'm not going to let this go!

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:10.040
Aren't you...

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:24.600
What are you trying to do?! Wasn't that your bodyguard?!

00:08:25.490 --> 00:08:27.240
Did you command them to steal it?!

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:31.410
For Burnsworth's little girl?!

00:08:35.300 --> 00:08:39.760
Turmoil within the family, civil war, and dwindling oil reserves.

00:08:40.590 --> 00:08:43.580
What's the benefit of possessing this country?

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:48.390
- Who do you think you're talking to?!
- You're done as a businessman!

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:51.960
You only have vengeance towards Harry Burnsworth on your mind!

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:54.280
You--- you!

00:09:02.570 --> 00:09:05.660
Director! Director!

00:09:06.450 --> 00:09:10.080
Director! Are you OK?! Director!

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:30.280
The tailor from Raginei is starting to recognize my body structure.

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:36.590
- Did you get that letter out?
- Yes, sir. - Thanks.

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:47.740
I didn't make it in time!

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:56.720
I can't find any leads!

00:09:57.040 --> 00:10:00.890
Master Kajika, Master Lee-Leng, where are you?!

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:19.050
It's been a while Toranosuke-san.

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:22.200
Sezun-san!

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:26.020
You look different.

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:29.940
- I didn't recognize you for a second.
- Is that so.

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:32.360
It's probably because I'm wearing different clothing.

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:35.390
<i>It must have been hard.</i>

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:40.040
Excuse me. 
Hello?

00:10:41.350 --> 00:10:43.160
Oh, hello ambassador.

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:46.540
Yes, yes.

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:50.140
A letter to the American Embassy?

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:58.070
- Isaac is going to be executed?!
- It's going to be a week from today.

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:07.910
- This can't be. 
- The Lieutenant was ready for this.

00:11:08.260 --> 00:11:11.130
He told us to stay still for situations like this.

00:11:11.450 --> 00:11:17.370
- No way, you're just going to let Isaac die?! 
- Kajika, stop it.

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:22.950
It's harder for them. They worked alongside with Noei for years.

00:11:28.010 --> 00:11:30.880
I'm sorry, I said something bad.

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:35.820
- I apologize. 
- Don't worry about it.

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:41.360
It's a sign that you're worried about the Lieutenant, Kajika-san.

00:11:46.170 --> 00:11:49.900
<i>I want to help Isaac out. Isn't there a way?</i>

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:53.560
<i>All I can do is mourn.</i>

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:56.750
<i>How frustrating!</i>

00:12:02.890 --> 00:12:06.400
Excuse me, Kajika-san you have a visitor.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:10.950
- Toranosuke! 
- Master Kajika! Master Lee-Leng!

00:12:11.530 --> 00:12:16.400
- I finally found you! 
- Toranosuke! I'm surprised you found us!

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:19.550
I'm glad that both of you are doing well!

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:22.710
It took me a long time to find you!

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:27.330
I found the old hideout, but I was too late getting there.

00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:32.170
Sezun-san was there to lead me here.

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:40.040
- Sezun!
- Master Kajika. Master Lee-Leng. I'm grateful to be with you again.

00:12:41.020 --> 00:12:46.530
- This is from the American embassy Master Kajika. 
- A letter?

00:12:52.300 --> 00:12:54.980
Look at this! It's from Mustafa!

00:13:00.450 --> 00:13:02.010
Mustafa!

00:13:08.190 --> 00:13:11.440
I trust that this letter gets to you.

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:15.330
Quinza and Najayra have joined forces.

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:19.880
The King's neurosis is so bad, he is like a dead man.

00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:25.270
<i>Quinza is having Najayra and the King get married in hopes of controlling them from behind the scenes.</i>

00:13:26.380 --> 00:13:29.380
I'm enjoying my life at the palace.

00:13:29.860 --> 00:13:32.400
I'm satisfied with the cooks and tailors of Raginei.

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:36.960
You have nothing to worry about. 
 Love M.

00:13:39.410 --> 00:13:42.020
Mustafa, you're doing OK!

00:13:45.110 --> 00:13:50.080
Sezun-san, this letter is helpful in rescuing Lieutenant Noei, right?!

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:54.540
- Is that true, Sezun?! 
- Isaac's life will be spared?!

00:13:56.070 --> 00:13:58.430
I've heard from the Chamberlains.

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:02.440
Lieutenant Noei was the only one not sent to prison.

00:14:03.020 --> 00:14:06.520
He is held in an old fashion jail inside the palace.

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:13.430
It is impossible to get into the state of the art prison but...

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:16.270
...there are a lot of holes in the palace.

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:19.390
So, there is a chance if we can get into the palace?

00:14:19.870 --> 00:14:22.510
- But how are we going to get in?
- Right.

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:26.010
We'll disguise ourselves as the tailor.

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:29.960
- That's it! 
- Now, who's going to go?

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:32.350
I will go. I know the palace well.

00:14:34.070 --> 00:14:38.530
It's too dangerous. There are many elite soldiers in the palace!

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:42.990
Unlike you guys, I am not a subordinate of Lieutenant Noei.

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:46.720
He won't get mad if I do something out of line.

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:51.850
Just as the Lieutenant commanded you, just worry about the country.

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:55.610
If we over stretch ourselves here, the network will collapse.

00:14:56.340 --> 00:15:00.860
- I will help you too! 
- Master Kajika!

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:06.340
- You can't... 
- Please, let me go with you.

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:10.130
I'm worried about Mustafa too.
 Kill two birds with one stone, right?

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:15.010
Don't be foolish!
 Don't you think so Master Lee-Leng?

00:15:15.420 --> 00:15:16.440
Lee-Leng.

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:25.650
- Are you serious? - Lee-Leng, I have something to talk to you about. Come along, Toranosuke.

00:15:27.520 --> 00:15:29.050
Yes, yes ma'm.

00:15:33.510 --> 00:15:37.850
I know that you guys are worried about me.

00:15:38.510 --> 00:15:42.340
But, I can't go back now. I'm an adult now!

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:45.300
I want to choose my own destiny!

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:49.820
If I turn my back on everyone right now, I'll regret it forever!

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:53.550
Don't let me choose that path!

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:59.120
Please, I beg you please.

00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:08.070
Master Kajika, please stop it!
 Please, raise your head. We understand!

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:12.150
I got it. Do things the way you want to.

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:15.620
- Master Lee-Leng?!
- Lee-Leng?!

00:16:16.260 --> 00:16:19.480
- Are you serious?! 
- Yes, I'm serious.

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:22.920
In that case, let me do as I please too.

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:32.760
I will step down as the leader of the Huang Group.

00:16:36.110 --> 00:16:38.530
- Master Lee-Leng?! 
- What are you talking about?!

00:16:39.290 --> 00:16:43.050
- You promised to let me do as I please, right? 
- Don't get mad!

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:48.750
He's right. There's no way the elders will let you step down!

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:51.680
Since I came here to Raginei...

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:55.090
...my right as the leader of the Huangs vanished.

00:16:55.730 --> 00:17:00.120
I left my position vacant. 
 It's no surprise if I get punished for it.

00:17:01.050 --> 00:17:03.280
- Toranosuke.
- Yes, sir.

00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:06.430
Can you contact Singapore from the embassy?

00:17:07.070 --> 00:17:09.170
Assign an interim leader in charge.

00:17:09.650 --> 00:17:11.970
I want Ken-Chang to step in.

00:17:12.640 --> 00:17:17.990
The handling of operations will be done by Zao. 
 I leave the rest up to the elders.

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:22.550
I got it.

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:26.820
Lee-Leng.
 Why? All of a sudden?

00:17:27.490 --> 00:17:29.370
Is it to make me second guess myself?

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:35.230
Would you go back if I take back what I just said?

00:17:37.270 --> 00:17:39.050
It's not something I came up with on a whim.

00:17:39.720 --> 00:17:44.270
Unless I had an opportunity like this, I wouldn't have been able to say this.

00:17:47.050 --> 00:17:51.310
Now, I don't have the backing of the Huang family but...

00:17:51.890 --> 00:17:55.010
-...do you not like that?
- Don't be foolish!

00:17:56.250 --> 00:17:59.910
Lee-Leng, you're Lee-Leng! 
No one can be your substitute!

00:18:01.730 --> 00:18:04.950
<i>I'm sorry, I'm sorry Lee-Leng.</i>

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:09.890
<i>I got you involved...</i>

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:12.940
<i>I don't know how I'm going to repay you for this.</i>

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:19.190
<i>This is the only way I can show my gratitude and my love.</i>

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:28.710
The next few days are going to be the toughest.

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:32.760
He'll be paralyzed even if he wakes up from the coma.

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:35.720
He'll never be back to normal.

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:39.190
Young Master, what should we do?!

00:18:40.020 --> 00:18:43.050
If word gets out, the world will be wrapped in chaos.

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:45.910
It will affect the company's stocks too.

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:49.510
- Keep it under wraps for a while.
- Yes, sir.

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:53.110
- Until a new plan is made. 
- I got it.

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:55.820
Looking back.

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:59.480
It was fortunate that we were getting ready to switch our leader.

00:19:01.550 --> 00:19:04.480
That was excessive. I apologize.

00:19:05.880 --> 00:19:09.870
- Can you leave me for a little while? 
- Yes, sir.

00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:20.790
<i>They are related even if their ties seemed severed.</i>

00:19:28.570 --> 00:19:31.180
My father might die any minute but...

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:36.880
...I have no pain in my heart. Did I have that much hate built up towards him?

00:19:38.470 --> 00:19:41.050
What an unfortunate human being I am.

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:48.760
I'm empty, I have nothing.

00:19:49.720 --> 00:19:51.630
I'm all dried up.

00:19:58.950 --> 00:19:59.940
Kajika!

00:20:02.490 --> 00:20:05.770
You're my only savior.

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:10.330
Where are you?! Kajika!

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:15.450
What is Master Lee-Leng thinking?!

00:20:17.170 --> 00:20:20.810
What's going to happen to the Huang family?

00:20:21.890 --> 00:20:25.420
The elders are panicking right now.

00:20:26.130 --> 00:20:29.150
That's what I thought. 
 Are you going to Raginei?

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:33.260
- Of course.
- I will go with you.

00:20:34.690 --> 00:20:38.490
- I'm going back to my homeland. 
- Don't be foolish!

00:20:38.930 --> 00:20:43.520
- If you enter that country you'll be killed! 
- I feel that the time is now.

00:20:44.980 --> 00:20:47.560
I believe Kajika felt that too.

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:51.390
That's why everyone is doing things above and beyond.

00:20:57.920 --> 00:21:00.270
Even if I ascend on the throne.

00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:02.960
When everyone is putting their life on the line...

00:21:03.210 --> 00:21:07.790
...the people would not want to follow me if I stay hiding in a safe place.

00:21:09.350 --> 00:21:13.940
What are you going to do? 
Are you going to Raginei to convince Lee-Leng?

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:19.510
I don't know. I just want to see him and see what he has to say.

00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:22.860
I had a feeling that this would come one day.

00:21:23.850 --> 00:21:26.490
I didn't know that he was thinking about this so deeply.

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:31.650
Lee-Leng evaluates others objectively and stringently.

00:21:32.700 --> 00:21:34.710
I believe he evaluated himself like that.

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:42.160
Having his personality, he must have been hung up on this issue for a while.

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:45.760
On that note, his decisions are final.

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:48.310
But, I can't accept that!

00:21:49.330 --> 00:21:54.200
I can't think of any other leader for the Huangs other than, Master Lee-Leng!

00:21:54.900 --> 00:21:57.200
What are the deserted ones like us to do?!

00:21:57.990 --> 00:22:01.590
What are the Huangs across the world to do?!

00:22:03.340 --> 00:22:06.720
I can't let him do that!

00:22:07.610 --> 00:22:09.270
<i>That's what I would think too.</i>

00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:13.890
<i>Lee-Leng never showed his weakness, even to Zao.</i>

00:22:14.910 --> 00:22:17.840
<i>He acted out as the perfect leader of the Huangs.</i>

00:22:19.370 --> 00:22:21.870
<i>I know how you feel Lee-Leng.</i>

00:22:22.030 --> 00:22:26.410
<i>You're a complex man and far from what you portrayed yourself to be.</i>

00:22:27.780 --> 00:22:31.850
<i>I don't know what happened in Raginei, but you've let it all go.</i>

00:22:32.910 --> 00:22:37.170
<i>Let the people say what they want.
 You've put up with a lot.</i>

00:22:38.670 --> 00:22:40.420
<i>I'm not going to put up with this any longer either!</i>

00:22:41.700 --> 00:22:46.540
<i>Pray for me. That I will be able to set foot in Raginei!</i>

00:22:47.810 --> 00:22:52.240
<i>If I'm not able to do that and I lose my life doing that...</i>

00:22:53.450 --> 00:22:55.810
<i>...pray for me that my life will be used for the cause.</i>

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:23.730
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
